<title>SPAIN: Clinton arrives to attend NATO summit.</title>
<headline>Clinton arrives to attend NATO summit.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. President Bill Clinton arrived in Madrid on Monday on the eve of an historic NATO summit.</p>
<p>Clinton and his wife Hillary flew into Madrid's military airport after spending a weekend on the Spanish holiday island of Majorca with Spain's King Juan Carlos and Queen Sofia.</p>
